## std::rand — CSPRNG-backed random_bytes / random_u64 / random_fill
## (Phase 2 #06.5 T8).
##
## This file is declarative documentation for the intended stdlib source
## layout. v1 still models the executable behavior through built-in
## resolver/codegen hooks rather than loading `.rvn` stdlib modules.
##
## Per-platform CSPRNG backend (compile-time `#if` in
## library/runtime/io/rand.c): Linux getrandom, macOS
## SecRandomCopyBytes (`-framework Security` at link), fallback
## /dev/urandom.

def random_bytes(n: Int) -> Result[Array[U8], IoError]
def random_u64() -> Int                            ## carries 64 random bits
def random_fill(buf: &var Array[U8]) -> Result[(), IoError]
